computability constructor. The previously exposed input record already pays
the window, arrow and membership facts, so no native calibration, finite
window or extra arithmetic premise is added. Every original finalInputs
tuple is a direct specialization. The two new Object pair codes are bound
internally; accepted application and target Object typing are conclusions. -/
